### OzWizard sample requests
### Open in VS Code (REST Client) or JetBrains HTTP client and click "Send Request".
### Run `npm run dev` first. Update @artifactId / @scanId from earlier responses.

@host = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Health
GET {{host}}/health

### 2. Inspect the active policy (thresholds, denylist)
GET {{host}}/policies

### 3. Submit an artifact (copy the "id" from the response into @artifactId below)
POST {{host}}/artifacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "payments-svc",
  "version": "2.3.0",
  "dependencies": [{ "name": "log4jira", "version": "2.10.0" }]
}

### 4. Scan the artifact -> verdict + findings (copy scan "id" into @scanId)
@artifactId = PASTE_ARTIFACT_ID_HERE
POST {{host}}/scans
Content-Type: application/json

{ "artifactId": "{{artifactId}}" }

### 5. Fetch a stored scan
@scanId = PASTE_SCAN_ID_HERE
GET {{host}}/scans/{{scanId}}

### 6. Escalate (record an override; effectiveVerdict -> allow, original kept)
POST {{host}}/escalations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scanId": "{{scanId}}",
  "reason": "patched fork in use",
  "requestedBy": "you"
}
